From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Norman Herms <dockseed@proton.me>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 16:22:32 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] mmc: sunxi: Add the A733 eMMC controller

The A733 eMMC controllers (SMHC2 and SMHC3) get a compatible of their
own. Bind it to a configuration that is a copy of the one the A733
controllers share today, so a device tree that moves the eMMC onto the
new compatible keeps every feature it has.

Not covered: the SD controller still has the eMMC features; that is the
next change.

Tested on Radxa Cubie A7S: the eMMC controller bound under the new
compatible, ran at HS400 with enhanced strobe, automatic CMD23 and the
card read threshold armed, and read the same data twice.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 drivers/mmc/host/sunxi-mmc.c | 19 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 19 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/mmc/host/sunxi-mmc.c b/drivers/mmc/host/sunxi-mmc.c
index b48559a6e780..017c85a87d64 100644
--- a/drivers/mmc/host/sunxi-mmc.c
+++ b/drivers/mmc/host/sunxi-mmc.c
@@ -2079,6 +2079,24 @@ static const struct sunxi_mmc_cfg sun60i_a733_cfg = {
 	.can_hsq = true,
 };
 
+static const struct sunxi_mmc_cfg sun60i_a733_emmc_cfg = {
+	.idma_des_size_bits = 13,
+	.idma_des_shift = 2,
+	.can_calibrate = true,
+	.mask_data0 = true,
+	.needs_new_timings = true,
+	.no_ceata_funs = true,
+	/* burst 16, RX trigger level 15, TX trigger level 240 */
+	.fifoth = 0x300f00f0,
+	.can_auto_cmd23 = true,
+	.thld_fifo_bytes = 1024,
+	.can_hs400 = true,
+	.ds_dl = 20,
+	.needs_a12a_init = true,
+	.can_wait_busy = true,
+	.can_hsq = true,
+};
+
 static const struct of_device_id sunxi_mmc_of_match[] = {
 	{ .compatible = "allwinner,sun4i-a10-mmc", .data = &sun4i_a10_cfg },
 	{ .compatible = "allwinner,sun5i-a13-mmc", .data = &sun5i_a13_cfg },
@@ -2091,6 +2109,7 @@ static const struct of_device_id sunxi_mmc_of_match[] = {
 	{ .compatible = "allwinner,sun50i-a100-mmc", .data = &sun20i_d1_cfg },
 	{ .compatible = "allwinner,sun50i-a100-emmc", .data = &sun50i_a100_emmc_cfg },
 	{ .compatible = "allwinner,sun50i-h616-mmc", .data = &sun50i_h616_cfg },
+	{ .compatible = "allwinner,sun60i-a733-emmc", .data = &sun60i_a733_emmc_cfg },
 	{ .compatible = "allwinner,sun60i-a733-mmc", .data = &sun60i_a733_cfg },
 	{ /* sentinel */ }
 };
